3. Modifications (LGPL-2.1, Section 2b)
---------------------------------------
  Changes Copyright (C) 2026 whx <253616211@qq.com>
  Date of change: 2026-10-29

  src_v/dbg_bridge.v
    - Memory interface ports renamed to AXI4 names (mem_* -> m_axi_*).
    - Added AXI4 attribute outputs: awsize, awprot, awcache, arsize,
      arprot, arcache.
    - Added byte-lane write strobes (mem_sel_q / mem_sel_r) driving
      m_axi_wstrb, replacing the fixed 4'b1111 strobe.
    - Removed the bid/rid ports; burst responses no longer depend on them.
    - rst_i is now an internal signal derived from ~m_axi_aresetn.
    - State machine, channel handshakes and GPIO write path rewritten and
      re-formatted; the UART wire protocol is unchanged.

  src_v/dbg_bridge_uart.v
    - Reworked TXD output generation: the original combinational txd_r
      logic is retained as a comment for reference, and txd_q is now driven
      directly from tx_bits_q / tx_shift_reg_q in the registered transmit
      path.

  Files ADDED by this fork (new work, not derived from the upstream RTL):
    sw/uart2axi_gui.py      Tkinter GUI for register / GPIO / memory access
    sw/build_exe.ps1        PyInstaller packaging script
    sw/pyproject.toml       uv / PEP 621 project metadata
    sw/README.md            usage notes for the sw/ tools
    sw/.gitignore
    sw/.python-version
    sw/uv.lock              generated lock file

